# Dependencies. In `link:` development mode this directory holds JUNCTIONS into
# the DSH app's own node_modules (see tools/dev-link.ps1). Committing those
# would give every clone broken links pointing at somebody else's install path,
# so the directory is never tracked.
node_modules/

# Packed artifacts from `tools/dev-link.ps1 -Mode pack`. Regenerated on demand,
# and a stale tarball is worse than none because the profile may still point at
# it.
*.tgz

# Local scratch: anything a developer drops in to try something.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
